{"b":"Ps","c":106,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"Praise ye the LORD. O give thanks unto the LORD; for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.","it":[[53,58],[79,87]],"x":[["1Thess.5.18",15,"w"],["Ps.105.1",12,"w"],["1Chr.16.34",12,"q"],["Ps.136.1",8,"q"],["Jer.33.11",7,"q"],["Ps.118.1",6,"q"],["Ps.105.45",5,"w"],["Ps.107.1",4,"q"],["Rom.5.20",4,"r"],["Rom.5.21",4,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Who can utter the mighty acts of the LORD? who can shew forth all his praise?","it":[[43,46]],"x":[["Rom.11.33",4,"r"],["Eph.1.19",4,"w"],["Ps.145.3",3,"r"],["Ps.145.12",3,"w"],["Ps.139.17",3,"r"],["Ps.139.18",3,"r"],["Job.26.14",2,"w"],["Job.5.9",2,"r"],["Ps.40.5",2,"w"],["Eph.3.18",2,"r"]]},{"n":3,"t":"Blessed are they that keep judgment, and he that doeth righteousness at all times.","it":[[8,11],[37,40]],"x":[["Ps.15.2",9,"w"],["Jas.1.25",5,"w"],["Gal.6.9",4,"r"],["John.13.17",4,"r"],["John.15.14",4,"r"],["Ps.119.112",3,"r"],["Rev.22.14",3,"w"],["Ps.119.1",3,"w"],["Ps.119.3",3,"r"],["Ps.119.20",3,"w"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Remember me, O LORD, with the favour that thou bearest unto thy people: O visit me with thy salvation;","it":[[37,59]],"tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.119.132",13,"r"],["Luke.23.42",11,"w"],["Neh.13.31",9,"w"],["Neh.13.14",9,"w"],["Ps.25.7",9,"w"],["Neh.13.22",6,"w"],["Acts.15.14",6,"w"],["Neh.5.19",6,"r"],["Luke.1.68",5,"r"],["Luke.1.69",5,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"That I may see the good of thy chosen, that I may rejoice in the gladness of thy nation, that I may glory with thine inheritance.","x":[["Ps.105.43",5,"w"],["Zeph.3.14",4,"w"],["Isa.66.10",4,"w"],["Isa.12.6",4,"r"],["John.15.16",4,"w"],["Zech.9.9",4,"w"],["Eph.1.18",4,"w"],["Ps.105.6",4,"w"],["Ps.1.3",4,"r"],["Ps.48.11",3,"w"]]},{"n":6,"t":"We have sinned with our fathers, we have committed iniquity, we have done wickedly.","x":[["Neh.9.16",6,"r"],["Ps.78.8",5,"r"],["Ezra.9.6",4,"r"],["Ezra.9.7",4,"r"],["1Kgs.8.47",4,"w"],["Dan.9.5",3,"e"],["Dan.9.8",3,"w"],["Lev.26.40",3,"w"],["Neh.9.32",3,"r"],["Neh.9.34",3,"r"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Our fathers understood not thy wonders in Egypt; they remembered not the multitude of thy mercies; but provoked him at the sea, even at the Red sea.","it":[[112,115],[128,132]],"x":[["Exod.14.11",8,"r"],["Exod.14.12",8,"r"],["Ps.78.42",5,"w"],["Ps.78.11",3,"w"],["2Thess.2.10",3,"r"],["2Thess.2.12",3,"r"],["Prov.1.22",3,"r"],["Deut.15.15",2,"r"],["Ps.5.7",2,"w"],["Deut.29.4",2,"r"]]},{"n":8,"t":"Nevertheless he saved them for his name’s sake, that he might make his mighty power to be known.","x":[["Exod.9.16",9,"w"],["Ezek.20.9",9,"e"],["Ezek.20.14",7,"w"],["Rom.9.17",6,"w"],["Ezek.20.44",6,"w"],["Jer.14.21",6,"w"],["Ezek.20.22",6,"e"],["Num.14.13",5,"r"],["Num.14.16",5,"r"],["Josh.7.9",5,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"He rebuked the Red sea also, and it was dried up: so he led them through the depths, as through the wilderness.","x":[["Ps.18.15",8,"r"],["Nah.1.4",7,"w"],["Exod.14.27",6,"w"],["Exod.14.29",6,"w"],["Ps.78.13",6,"w"],["Exod.14.21",6,"w"],["Exod.14.22",6,"w"],["Isa.63.11",6,"w"],["Isa.63.14",6,"r"],["Isa.51.10",6,"w"]]},{"n":10,"t":"And he saved them from the hand of him that hated them, and redeemed them from the hand of the enemy.","it":[[50,55]],"x":[["Exod.14.30",7,"w"],["Ps.107.2",7,"e"],["Mic.6.4",4,"w"],["Ps.136.24",3,"w"],["Job.6.22",3,"r"],["Job.6.23",3,"w"],["Neh.9.11",2,"r"],["Exod.15.13",2,"w"],["Exod.15.9",2,"w"],["Exod.15.10",2,"r"]]},{"n":11,"t":"And the waters covered their enemies: there was not one of them left.","x":[["Exod.15.5",5,"w"],["Exod.14.27",3,"r"],["Exod.14.28",3,"w"],["Exod.14.13",3,"r"],["Ps.78.53",3,"w"],["Exod.15.19",2,"w"],["Exod.15.10",2,"w"]]},{"n":12,"t":"Then believed they his words; they sang his praise.","x":[["Exod.14.31",6,"w"],["Exod.15.21",6,"r"],["Luke.8.13",3,"r"],["John.8.30",3,"w"],["John.8.31",3,"w"]]},{"n":13,"t":"They soon forgat his works; they waited not for his counsel:","x":[["Exod.15.24",8,"r"],["Ps.78.11",8,"w"],["Exod.16.2",7,"r"],["Isa.48.17",6,"r"],["Isa.48.18",6,"r"],["Prov.1.25",5,"w"],["Ps.107.11",5,"w"],["Exod.17.2",4,"r"],["Exod.17.7",3,"r"],["Prov.1.30",3,"w"]]},{"n":14,"t":"But lusted exceedingly in the wilderness, and tempted God in the desert.","x":[["1Cor.10.9",6,"w"],["1Cor.10.6",5,"w"],["Num.11.4",5,"r"],["Exod.17.2",5,"r"],["Heb.3.8",3,"w"],["Heb.3.10",3,"r"],["Deut.9.22",2,"r"],["Ps.78.40",2,"w"],["Ps.78.41",2,"w"],["Num.11.33",2,"r"]]},{"n":15,"t":"And he gave them their request; but sent leanness into their soul.","x":[["Isa.10.16",4,"w"],["Num.11.31",4,"r"],["Num.11.34",4,"r"],["Ps.78.29",2,"r"],["Ps.78.31",2,"r"],["Isa.24.16",1,"w"]]},{"n":16,"t":"They envied Moses also in the camp, and Aaron the saint of the LORD.","it":[[36,39]],"x":[["Num.16.1",8,"r"],["Num.16.50",8,"w"],["Lev.21.10",3,"r"],["Lev.21.12",3,"r"],["Lev.21.6",2,"r"],["Lev.21.8",2,"r"],["Exod.28.36",2,"r"]]},{"n":17,"t":"The earth opened and swallowed up Dathan, and covered the company of Abiram.","x":[["Deut.11.6",8,"e"],["Num.26.10",5,"e"],["Num.16.29",5,"r"],["Num.16.33",5,"r"]]},{"n":18,"t":"And a fire was kindled in their company; the flame burned up the wicked.","x":[["Heb.12.29",4,"r"],["Num.16.46",3,"r"],["Num.16.35",3,"r"],["Num.16.40",3,"w"]]},{"n":19,"t":"They made a calf in Horeb, and worshipped the molten image.","x":[["Exod.32.35",3,"w"],["Exod.32.4",3,"w"],["Exod.32.8",3,"w"],["Acts.7.41",2,"w"],["Neh.9.18",2,"w"],["1Cor.10.7",2,"r"],["Deut.9.21",2,"w"],["Deut.9.12",2,"w"],["Deut.9.16",2,"w"],["Deut.9.8",2,"w"]]},{"n":20,"t":"Thus they changed their glory into the similitude of an ox that eateth grass.","x":[["Jer.2.11",7,"w"],["Exod.20.4",5,"r"],["Exod.20.5",5,"r"],["Rom.1.22",5,"r"],["Rom.1.23",5,"w"],["Ps.89.17",4,"w"],["Isa.40.18",4,"r"],["Isa.40.25",4,"r"]]},{"n":21,"t":"They forgat God their saviour, which had done great things in Egypt;","x":[["Ps.78.42",4,"r"],["Ps.78.51",4,"r"],["Jer.2.32",4,"r"],["Ps.106.13",3,"w"],["Deut.10.21",3,"e"],["Ps.78.11",3,"w"],["Ps.78.12",3,"r"],["Deut.4.34",3,"e"],["Deut.32.17",3,"r"],["Deut.32.18",3,"r"]]},{"n":22,"t":"Wondrous works in the land of Ham, and terrible things by the Red sea.","it":[[35,38]],"x":[["Ps.105.23",4,"w"],["Ps.78.51",4,"w"],["Exod.14.25",3,"r"],["Exod.14.28",3,"w"],["Exod.15.10",2,"w"],["Ps.105.27",2,"w"],["Ps.105.36",2,"r"]]},{"n":23,"t":"Therefore he said that he would destroy them, had not Moses his chosen stood before him in the breach, to turn away his wrath, lest he should destroy them.","it":[[150,155]],"x":[["Deut.9.25",6,"w"],["Deut.9.13",6,"r"],["Deut.9.14",6,"w"],["Jas.5.16",4,"r"],["Ezek.22.30",4,"w"],["Num.16.5",3,"w"],["Ps.105.6",3,"w"],["Ezek.20.8",3,"r"],["Ezek.13.5",3,"r"],["Exod.32.32",3,"r"]]},{"n":24,"t":"Yea, they despised the pleasant land, they believed not his word:","x":[["Deut.1.32",7,"r"],["Num.14.31",6,"w"],["Heb.3.18",6,"w"],["Heb.3.19",6,"r"],["Ezek.20.6",6,"r"],["Heb.4.6",5,"r"],["Matt.22.5",3,"r"],["Deut.11.11",3,"r"],["Deut.11.12",3,"r"],["Deut.8.7",3,"r"]]},{"n":25,"t":"But murmured in their tents, and hearkened not unto the voice of the LORD.","it":[[29,32]],"x":[["Heb.3.7",4,"r"],["Heb.3.8",4,"r"],["Deut.1.26",4,"r"],["Deut.1.27",4,"e"],["Heb.3.15",4,"r"],["Num.14.22",4,"w"],["Ps.95.7",4,"r"],["Ps.95.9",4,"r"],["Num.14.1",2,"r"],["Num.14.4",2,"r"]]},{"n":26,"t":"Therefore he lifted up his hand against them, to overthrow them in the wilderness:","x":[["Ezek.20.15",8,"e"],["Num.14.28",7,"r"],["Num.14.35",7,"w"],["Ps.95.11",5,"r"],["Heb.3.11",5,"r"],["Deut.1.34",3,"r"],["Deut.1.35",3,"r"],["Exod.6.8",3,"r"],["Heb.3.18",3,"r"],["Gen.14.22",2,"r"]]},{"n":27,"t":"To overthrow their seed also among the nations, and to scatter them in the lands.","x":[["Lev.26.33",5,"w"],["Ps.44.11",5,"r"],["Deut.28.64",3,"w"],["Deut.28.65",3,"w"],["Ezek.20.23",3,"w"],["Deut.32.26",2,"w"],["Deut.32.27",2,"r"],["Deut.4.26",2,"r"],["Deut.4.27",2,"w"],["Deut.28.37",2,"w"]]},{"n":28,"t":"They joined themselves also unto Baal-peor, and ate the sacrifices of the dead.","x":[["Num.25.1",5,"r"],["Num.25.3",5,"e"],["Num.25.5",5,"e"],["Hos.9.10",5,"w"],["Jer.10.8",4,"r"],["Jer.10.10",4,"r"],["Deut.4.3",4,"w"],["1Cor.10.19",4,"r"],["1Cor.10.20",4,"r"],["Deut.32.17",3,"r"]]},{"n":29,"t":"Thus they provoked him to anger with their inventions: and the plague brake in upon them.","it":[[19,22]],"x":[["1Cor.10.8",3,"r"],["Deut.32.16",3,"w"],["Deut.32.21",3,"w"],["Ps.99.8",2,"w"],["Rom.1.21",2,"r"],["Rom.1.24",2,"r"],["Ps.106.39",2,"w"],["Num.25.9",2,"w"],["Eccl.7.29",2,"w"]]},{"n":30,"t":"Then stood up Phinehas, and executed judgment: and so the plague was stayed.","it":[[51,53]],"x":[["Num.25.6",10,"r"],["Num.25.8",10,"w"],["Josh.7.12",7,"r"],["Num.25.14",7,"r"],["Num.25.15",7,"r"],["Deut.13.9",5,"r"],["Deut.13.11",5,"r"],["1Kgs.18.40",5,"r"],["1Kgs.18.41",5,"r"],["Jonah.1.12",5,"r"]]},{"n":31,"t":"And that was counted unto him for righteousness unto all generations for evermore.","x":[["Num.25.11",6,"r"],["Num.25.13",6,"r"],["Gen.15.6",2,"w"],["Deut.24.13",2,"w"],["Mark.14.3",2,"r"],["Mark.14.9",2,"r"]]},{"n":32,"t":"They angered him also at the waters of strife, so that it went ill with Moses for their sakes:","it":[[13,16]],"x":[["Num.20.2",5,"r"],["Num.20.13",5,"r"],["Deut.4.21",4,"w"],["Deut.1.37",4,"w"],["Ps.81.7",4,"w"],["Num.20.23",4,"r"],["Num.20.24",4,"r"],["Deut.3.26",3,"w"],["Num.27.13",3,"r"],["Num.27.14",3,"w"]]},{"n":33,"t":"Because they provoked his spirit, so that he spake unadvisedly with his lips.","x":[["Num.20.10",4,"r"],["Num.20.11",4,"r"],["Ps.107.11",3,"r"],["Ps.39.1",3,"r"],["Jas.3.2",3,"r"],["Ps.78.40",3,"r"],["Ps.141.3",2,"w"],["Job.2.10",2,"w"],["Gen.35.16",1,"r"],["Gen.35.18",1,"r"]]},{"n":34,"t":"They did not destroy the nations, concerning whom the LORD commanded them:","x":[["Judg.1.21",6,"r"],["Deut.7.16",6,"r"],["Deut.7.2",6,"w"],["Josh.23.12",4,"w"],["Josh.23.13",4,"w"],["Matt.17.19",4,"r"],["Matt.17.20",4,"r"],["Num.33.55",3,"r"],["Num.33.56",3,"r"],["1Sam.15.22",3,"r"]]},{"n":35,"t":"But were mingled among the heathen, and learned their works.","x":